# Pairs with GateOwnership. A leaked gate refuses every later split of C.
MODULE: SiblingKeepsGate
TARGET: GateOwnership
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: SetPrevSiblingAsync returns without releasing C's split gate
PERTURBS: SiblingFinish

--- FIND
    /\ sib = "writing"
    /\ gate' = [gate EXCEPT !["C"] = "free"]
--- REPLACE
    /\ sib = "writing"
    \* MUTATION: the gate is kept
    /\ gate' = gate
--- END
